@startuml uc-pat-01-class-design-client
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
set separator none
left to right direction

title UC-PAT-01: Design Class Diagram – client slice (sescam-client-app)\nC5 sescam-admissions v1.1.0 – <<NEW>> = added by PAT-01, the rest exists since UC-AAD-05

package "sescam-client-app (com.sescam.radiodiagnostics.client.admissions)" {
  class MyAppointmentsViewController <<Controller, NEW>> {
    - apiClient : AppointmentApiClient
    + list(...) : String  <<GET /my-appointments>>
    + details(id, ...) : String  <<GET .../{id}>>
    + confirm(id, version, ...) : String  <<POST .../{id}/confirm>>
    + rescheduleForm(id, ...) : String  <<GET .../{id}/reschedule>>
    + requestReschedule(id, form, ...) : String  <<POST .../{id}/reschedule>>
    + cancelForm(id, ...) : String  <<GET .../{id}/cancel>>
    + cancel(id, form, ...) : String  <<POST .../{id}/cancel>>
    - showError(BookingClientException, model) : String
    .. (...) = model, redirect, X-Actor-Id, X-Actor-Role ..
  }

  class AppointmentApiClient <<Component, NEW>> {
    - restClient : RestClient
    + listMyAppointments(actorId, actorRole) : List<AppointmentSummaryDTO>
    + getDetails(id, actorId, actorRole) : AppointmentDetailsDTO
    + confirm(id, expectedBookingVersion, actorId, actorRole) : AppointmentDetailsDTO
    + requestReschedule(id, ReschedulePayload, actorId, actorRole) : RescheduleRequestStatusDTO
    + cancel(id, CancelPayload, actorId, actorRole) : AppointmentDetailsDTO
    ~ toException(ClientHttpResponse) : BookingClientException
  }
  class "AppointmentApiClient.ReschedulePayload" as ReschedulePayload <<record, NEW>> {
    reason, preferredDates
  }
  class "AppointmentApiClient.CancelPayload" as CancelPayload <<record, NEW>> {
    expectedBookingVersion, reason, priorityWarningAcknowledged
  }

  class RescheduleRequestForm <<NEW>> {
    - reason : String
    - preferredDates : List<LocalDate>
    + validate(today) : Map<String, String>
    + toPayload() : ReschedulePayload
  }
  class CancellationForm <<NEW>> {
    - reason : String
    - confirmed : boolean
    - priorityWarningAcknowledged : boolean
    - expectedBookingVersion : long
    + validate(PriorityLevel) : Map<String, String>
    + toPayload() : CancelPayload
  }

  class BookingClientException <<exception>> {
    - code : String
    - statusCode : int
    - invalidFields : List<String>
    + getCode() : String
    + getStatusCode() : int
  }

  class "my-appointments/list.html" as ListView <<Thymeleaf view, NEW>> {
    appointments in chronological order
    date, time, examination, modality, location, status
    "no upcoming appointments" + link to follow-ups (A1)
  }
  class "my-appointments/detail.html" as DetailView <<Thymeleaf view, NEW>> {
    details + preparation instructions
    buttons from allowedActions only
    pending request status (A2, A6)
    status + actions disabled (A7)
    service contact (A5)
  }
  class "my-appointments/reschedule.html" as RescheduleView <<Thymeleaf view, NEW>> {
    reason, preferred dates
  }
  class "my-appointments/cancel.html" as CancelView <<Thymeleaf view, NEW>> {
    "Are you sure?" + reason
    clinical priority warning + checkbox (A4)
  }
}

package "sescam-common (common.admissions, common.orders)" {
  class AppointmentSummaryDTO <<record>>
  class AppointmentDetailsDTO <<record>>
  class RescheduleRequestStatusDTO <<record>>
  enum BookingStatus
  enum AppointmentAction
  enum PriorityLevel
}

package "sescam-server-app" {
  class PatientAppointmentRestController {
    GET /api/v1/my-appointments
    GET /api/v1/my-appointments/{id}
    POST .../{id}/confirm
    POST .../{id}/reschedule-requests
    POST .../{id}/cancel
  }
}

MyAppointmentsViewController --> AppointmentApiClient
MyAppointmentsViewController ..> RescheduleRequestForm : binds
MyAppointmentsViewController ..> CancellationForm : binds
MyAppointmentsViewController ..> ListView : renders
MyAppointmentsViewController ..> DetailView : renders
MyAppointmentsViewController ..> RescheduleView : renders
MyAppointmentsViewController ..> CancelView : renders
RescheduleRequestForm ..> ReschedulePayload : creates
CancellationForm ..> CancelPayload : creates
CancellationForm ..> PriorityLevel
AppointmentApiClient ..> ReschedulePayload : sends
AppointmentApiClient ..> CancelPayload : sends
AppointmentApiClient ..> AppointmentSummaryDTO
AppointmentApiClient ..> AppointmentDetailsDTO
AppointmentApiClient ..> RescheduleRequestStatusDTO
AppointmentApiClient ..> BookingClientException : <<throws>>
DetailView ..> AppointmentAction : shows buttons
AppointmentApiClient ..> PatientAppointmentRestController : REST/JSON\nX-Actor-Id, X-Actor-Role

note bottom of CancellationForm
  confirmed must be true (explicit confirmation, A3).
  If priority is STAT_URGENT or PREFERENTIAL,
  priorityWarningAcknowledged must be true (A4).
end note

note bottom of BookingClientException
  Same exception as the AAD-05 client.
  Codes the view handles:
  403 UNAUTHORIZED_BOOKING_ACCESS (A8),
  404 BOOKING_NOT_FOUND,
  409 REQUEST_ALREADY_PROCESSED / CONCURRENT_BOOKING (A7),
  409 BOOKING_CONFLICT -> show serviceContact (A5),
  409 DUPLICATE_PENDING_REQUEST -> reload pending request (A6),
  400 INVALID_BOOKING_DATA (+ invalidFields).
end note
@enduml
